    "consequences": {
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "the-domino-effect",
          "title": "THE DOMINO EFFECT",
          "description": "Ignoring an EGR warning light is a false economy. A stuck-open EGR valve allows excessive exhaust gas into the engine, causing a rich fuel mixture, black smoke, and severe carbon build-up.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": "h3",
              "id": "",
              "text": "CARBON SPREADS DOWNSTREAM"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": "h4",
              "id": "",
              "text": "Intake Manifold"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Carbon restricts airflow, worsening performance and fuel economy"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": "h4",
              "id": "",
              "text": "Diesel Particulate Filter (DPF)"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Excessive soot rapidly clogs the DPF, leading to a £1,000+ replacement"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": "h4",
              "id": "",
              "text": "Turbocharger"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Carbon debris can damage turbo vanes or restrict the variable geometry mechanism"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": "h3",
              "id": "",
              "text": "THE COST ESCALATION"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Today:"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "£70–£120 EGR clean"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "£70–£120"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "In 6 months:"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "EGR clean + potential DPF repair"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "£1,000+"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "In 12 months:"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "EGR, DPF and turbo repairs can combine"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "£2,600+"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Addressing carbon build-up early can help prevent more costly intake manifold, DPF and turbo repairs."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": "h3",
              "id": "",
              "text": "RED FLAG ENGINES – KNOWN EGR FAILURE PATTERNS"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Engines with known EGR issues"
            },
            {
