                  "meta": "",
                  "icon": "",
                  "items": [],
                  "fullText": "01 Regular long drives Ensure the vehicle regularly completes journeys of at least 20–30 minutes at sustained speeds. This allows the engine to reach optimal operating temperature, helping to burn off light carbon deposits naturally."
